# EORA - Exclusive OR Accumulator A (Immediate: 0x88)

---
name: immediate
memory: 88 0F
setup: a=F0
expect: a=FF N=1 V=0
cycles: 2

---
name: direct
memory: 98 42
setup: a=FF
at 0042: AA
expect: a=55 N=0 Z=0 V=0
cycles: 3

---
name: indexed
memory: A8 10
setup: a=FF x=1000
at 1010: AA
expect: a=55 N=0 Z=0 V=0
cycles: 4

